    "faq": {
      "title": "Frequently Asked Questions",
      "q1": "Is SmileCheck free?",
      "a1": "Yes! The Free plan is free forever. You can upgrade to Pro or Premium at any time to unlock additional features.",
      "q2": "How do points work?",
      "a2": "You earn points by confirming appointments, arriving on time, maintaining good oral hygiene and much more. 100 points = €10 that you can spend in the Rewards Store.",
      "q3": "Are teleconsultations secure?",
      "a3": "Yes. Teleconsultations are conducted via encrypted video call directly on the platform. It costs just €20 per consultation.",
      "q4": "Can I use SmileCheck on multiple devices?",
      "a4": "Yes! SmileCheck works on any device — computer, tablet or mobile.",
      "q5": "How does the level system work?",
      "a5": "There are 7 levels: Can, Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum, Diamond and Adamantine. The more points you accumulate, the higher your level and the greater the benefits.",
      "q6": "Does SmileCheck replace Doctolib?",
      "a6": "No. SmileCheck complements Doctolib by adding gamification, integrated teleconsultations, oral health management and a unique rewards system.",
      "q7": "Is my data protected?",
      "a7": "Yes. We comply with GDPR and all data is encrypted and stored securely."
    },
